<circle r="1"/><svg>
--- runtime error ---
Fatal error: a function wrote output inside a `<script>`, an attribute, a URL, CSS, a comment, `<svg>`/`<math>`, a `<select>` or the text of an element such as `<textarea>`, where HTML escaping does not protect it (or browsers read its markup in another way); return the value (or `Html`) from the function and insert it with `<?= ?>`
